  "ruleText": "Saf-C 7303.01 Eligible Applicants. Entities eligible to apply for loans shall include local governments in the state of New Hampshire only.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Saf-C 5900) #13168, 2-19-21",
